      "lines": [
        "问题"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们用什么方法获取关于自然现象的知识？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "2",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "观察与实验有什么区别？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "3",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "你知道哪些物理仪器？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "5. 物理量　物理量的测量"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "为了得到关于物理现象的尽可能准确的知识，在做实验",
        "时就需要进行测量. 例如，要知道水的体积与水的温度之间",
        "的关系，就要把水加热来测量这两个量."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "体积和温度都是物理量."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "长度、面积、时间、速度、力等也都是物理量."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "物理量总是可以测量的. 测量某一个量，就是把该量与",
        "取做这种量的单位的同类量进行比较. 例如，测量桌子的长"
      ]
    },
